@participant2 @participant10 I managed to get it work on version 52.

The configuration has changed in the new version (https://docs.expo.dev/versions/latest/sdk/splash-screen/)

```
{
  "expo": {
    "plugins": [
      [
        "expo-splash-screen",
        {
          "backgroundColor": "#232323",
          "image": "./assets/splash-icon.png",
          "dark": {
            "image": "./assets/splash-icon-dark.png",
            "backgroundColor": "#000000"
          },
          "imageWidth": 200
        }
      ]
    ],
  }
}
```

After that splashscreen was visible again without any issues.

> Upgrading to sdk 52 and using the latest versions solved this issue for me.

